WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
One team, one visual memory.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.500
The director packs rules, samples, fonts and source.

00:06.500 --> 00:09.500
Members continue character, environment, UI and item families from the same version.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.500
Compose and interact: merge, orders, inventory, rewards and unlocks.

00:14.500 --> 00:22.000
Repair the dock, light the workshop and welcome the boat. Check poses, day/night and effects together.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
Carry the director's decisions into every delivery.
